  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Aviation Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment builds on Australia&#x2019;s support provided through the Pacific Flights Program in response to the COVID-19 pandemic. It seeks to support improved aviation safety, quality and sustainability and keep the Pacific connected through engagement with relevant government ministries, airport authorities, civil aviation regulators and meteorological services. It includes the development of more harmonised aviation strategies, policies and regulations; aviation skills, education and training; improved safety and quality systems and strengthened aviation meteorological capabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
